  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U4 Anti-Corruption Resource  center 2017-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to U4 Anti-corruption Resource Centre: Aim is to identify and propose informed solutions to partners for reducin the hamful impact of corruption on sustainable development through 1) Produce and communicate knowledge on anti-corruption practice and policy, 2) Generate and test innovative approaches to advance the field of anti-corruption practice and policy, 3) Build partner capacities for anti-corruption work and 4) promote and facilitate dialogue, critical reflection and learning</narrative>
  </description>
